			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"路通",
					"加爾恰",
					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710980101,
					"content": "先生，值得一提的是，算上今天，我們已經連續吃了整整六天的蘿蔔時蔬湯了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980102,
					"content": "除卻費用危機之外，我們的腸胃問題也已經不可忽視…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980103,
					"content": "你說得對！非常對，親愛的路通，你總是這麼敏銳！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980104,
					"content": "我們也許正是因為腸胃問題，才不能準確地判斷出這道菜的味道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980105,
					"content": "我們得去找個旁證！路通，得去找個第三方旁證才行！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980106,
					"content": "謝謝誇獎，先生。但我的重點其實並不在此…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980107,
						710980108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980107,
					"content": "請問，諸位在做什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980109
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710980109,
					"content": "啊…哈！咱們的旁證者來了，太棒了！甚至還不止一個！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980110,
					"content": "欸？什、什麼？旁證者？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980111,
					"content": "你說我們？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710980112,
					"content": "沒錯，您吃過蘿蔔時蔬湯嗎？熟悉它的味道嗎？明白它的做法嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980113,
					"content": "先生，你得先說清楚事情的原委…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980114,
					"content": "#嗯…吃過！熟悉！{NICKNAME}會做！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980115,
					"content": "派蒙，妳得先聽清楚事情的原委…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980116
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710980116,
					"content": "還是由我來陳述一下我們的委託吧…希望您願意接受。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980117,
					"content": "我是路通，這位是我的老闆，來自楓丹的加爾恰先生。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980118,
					"content": "加爾恰先生正在研究一種…嗯…被他稱為「推數機」的東西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980119,
					"content": "具體來說，就是一種能夠…幫人計算各種數值的工具，我這麼概括對嗎，先生？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980120,
					"content": "非常準確，親愛的路通，「推數機」的功能就是這麼簡潔。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980121,
					"content": "對，要簡潔…必須要簡潔，那個轉化符太複雜了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980122,
					"content": "但是，這些和蘿蔔時蔬湯又有什麼關係？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980123,
					"content": "這部分就由加爾恰先生來說明吧，先生？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980124,
					"content": "可是要怎麼簡化…喔！是的，沒問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980125,
					"content": "呃…我們得從簡單的地方開始說，你們知道「公式」嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980126,
					"content": "公式？嗯…沒聽說過…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980127,
					"content": "不太瞭解…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980128
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710980128,
					"content": "好吧…沒關係，你們就把公式理解成…嗯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980129,
					"content": "一個…一個用於表達各個量之間的一定關係的式子，有一定的普遍應用性…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980130,
					"content": "欸？欸…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980131,
					"content": "聽起來很厲害…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980132
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710980132,
					"content": "簡單來說，在「推數機」的輔助下，我們正在嘗試寫出「蘿蔔時蔬湯」的食譜公式。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980133,
					"content": "加爾恰先生相信，只要找到了正確的公式，我們就能將「蘿蔔時蔬湯」的做法轉寫為一種…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980134,
					"content": "一種「通用式流程」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980135,
					"content": "一種…「傻瓜式流程」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980136,
					"content": "只要按照這種流程操作，無論是誰都能烹飪出美味的「蘿蔔時蔬湯」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980137,
					"content": "聽起來好麻煩…就不能直接找人請教做菜方法嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980138
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980138,
					"content": "這種方法…實在是太過考驗人的天賦了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980139,
					"content": "像我和加爾恰先生這種對烹飪毫無天賦的人，就算是廚師教得再認真，我們也完全無法學到精髓。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980140
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980140,
					"content": "這一點，我相信這家客棧的言笑先生有著十分深刻的體會…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980141,
						710980143
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980141,
					"content": "你們需要我們幫忙算「公式」嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980142
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710980142,
					"content": "當然不會，我絕不會拿這件事來為難您。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980145
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980145,
					"content": "準確地來說，我們是希望您為我們提供一個「第三方旁證」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980146
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980146,
					"content": "通俗地來說，就是請您來嚐一嚐加爾恰先生按照公式製作出來的「蘿蔔時蔬湯」，給出您的意見。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980147
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980147,
					"content": "總之，就是幫你們嚐嚐好吃的，對吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980148
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980148,
					"content": "妳總結得也太簡單了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980149
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710980149,
					"content": "沒關係啦，按照「公式」做出來的「蘿蔔時蔬湯」，我還從來沒吃過呢，我們就去嚐嚐看吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980150
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980150,
					"content": "那麼，這件事就這樣說定了，我剛向言笑先生預約了他的廚房，我們先上去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980151
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980151,
					"content": "加爾恰先生？您在聽嗎？我們還是按照之前的步驟來實驗嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980152
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980152,
					"content": "呃？噢！抱歉，我準是又走神了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980153
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980153,
					"content": "那些參數在我腦子裡打轉，就是不聽我使喚…沒錯，還是按照之前的三道步驟來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980143,
					"content": "你們需要我們教你們做菜嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980144
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710980144,
					"content": "呃…也不完全是。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980145
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710980108,
					"content": "關於蘿蔔時蔬湯的「製作公式」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710980109
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7109803,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
